<DIV CLASS="title2"><cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural#</cfoutput>/DIV>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
Finding <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> to add to a Contract or Payable begins with searching via either the Drop Down Menus, Search Strings, or a combination of both.  To use the Drop Down Menu, click on the arrow for whichever category you want to search under.  The categories include Family Names (this will list all the <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_singular)#</cfoutput> locations by the corporate name), Brokers (this will list all <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> a specific broker services), States (this will list all <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> in a specific state), and Broker Market Areas (this will list all <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> in a specific broker market).  
<BR><BR>
After you click on the arrow (to the right of each category), use your mouse to make a selection.  You can also make selections in multiple areas (i.e., select “SYSCO” in the Family Names and “CA” for States, the result would be all SYSCO houses in California).  After making your selections from the Drop Down Menu(s) click on the “Search” button to the right of the Search String window.  You will receive a list of <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> that you can either individually select or click the box in the upper left hand corner of your Search Results (orange bar) to check all.  
<BR><BR>
You may also choose the Select All <cfoutput>#application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural#</cfoutput> option, if in fact ALL <cfoutput>#lcase(application.returned_customer_setting.distributor_label_plural)#</cfoutput> are eligible.  
</BLOCKQUOTE>


